  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Behaviour Change Communication on Cholera and the threat of Ebola in Ghana is a component of Support the Government of Ghana&#x2019;s response to the ongoing cholera outbreak reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xA3;2,114,393. It works in the following sector(s): Infectious disease control, Basic health care, Reproductive health care.</narrative>
